WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.190
Never gotten clearance
to land that fast before.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:09.060
You must be special.

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:13.560
Leon?

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:14.610
Claire?

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.860
Could you take a look at something?

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:20.190
A little boy drew them.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.810
I can't get anyone to go on record.

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:25.440
Doesn't that look a lot like Raccoon City?

00:00:26.810 --> 00:00:27.810
I gotta go.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:30.400
Don't do anything stupid.

00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:32.270
Hey, Leon.

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:34.520
That outfit doesn't suit you.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.560
Let's get the President to the bunker.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:48.610
Anything even remotely hostile
gets a headshot.

